! colspan="3" |'''The Budding/Sprouting Era (0–1268):'''
|-
|
|
|
*The Eldritch Kin of Chaos (of The Original Creator) gradually dwindled and eliminated. A mythical era of rivalry among King of Giants, King of Elves, King of Mutants, Dragon, Phoenix, Demonic Wolf, Races of the Sea, and Demons began. At this time, except for mutants and werewolves who were divided, the giants, elves, vampires, and humans are still coexisting as a single unified “human” race (or race of humanoids), they have yet to split.
*'''First-generation of Ancient Gods''' appeared one after another. The sky, the land, the sea, and the underground world slowly changed from disorderliness to orderliness.<ref name="C1067" />
*After the supernatural races obtained a certain level of intelligence and had their own languages, creatures finally had some knowledge of history. The first language, [[Languages#Elvish|Elvish]], was created by the first-generation Elf King.<ref name="C1067" />
|-
