*[[Giant King Aurmir]] betrayed [[Lilith|Sanguine Ancestor Lilith]] and caused "Her" to perish. [[Mutated King Kvastir]] and [[Annihilation Demonic Wolf Flegrea]] also died with "Her".<ref name="C1066">{{Cite Book|1|1066}}</ref>
