**[[Phoenix Ancestor Gregrace]] created the Underworld that exists in the [[Spirit World]].<ref>{{Cite Book|1|480}}</ref>
***"She" transferred [[Calderón City]] and hid the clues about the [[River of Eternal Darkness]] inside.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|920}}</ref>
