|-
| c. 3,000 BA
|
|
*The [[Evernight Goddess]]' followers formed a secret organization.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|1064}}</ref>
**The Revelation of Evernight indicates that the church is nearly 3000 years old, but there are mythical legends before that.<ref name="C142">{{Cite Book|1|142}}</ref>
|-
|
|{{Tl-abbr|?}}
|
*[[Ancient Sun God]] fought against the ancient gods and took "Their" powers.
**[[Dragon of Imagination Ankewelt]], [[Elf King Soniathrym]], [[Phoenix Ancestor Gregrace]], [[Giant King Aurmir]] perished because of  "Him".
**[[Devil Monarch Farbauti]] escaped to the [[Abyss]] and hid there ever since. "He" goes by the name "'''Dark Side of the Universe'''" in the [[Fifth Epoch]].
***After the Second Epoch, the [[Abyss]] had never revealed itself to the world again.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|1129}}</ref> After an unknown period of time, before Roselle's era in the Fifth epoch, it had changed and it was no longer suitable for devils to survive.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|1128}}</ref>
|-
