*[[Omebella]] fell at the end of the Second Epoch. "Her" corpse became a Grade 0 Sealed Artifact [[Gift of the Land]], which is owned by the current [[City of Silver]].<ref>{{Cite Book|1|571}}</ref><ref name="C1266">{{Cite Book|1|1266}}</ref>
***[[Lilith]] pretended to be [[Omebella]] from this point forward with the help of the [[Ancient Sun God]] and the [[Evernight Goddess]].<ref>{{Cite Book|1|1269}}</ref>
**[[Queen of Calamity Cohinem]] split "Her" Beyonder characteristics and was in an unstable state.
**[[God of Knowledge and Wisdom|Dragon of Wisdom]] turned to the Ancient Sun God and became the Wisdom Angel, one of "His" Kings of Angels.
